ard bag. No fixed home, allegiance, or campaign history is assigned.\n\n## Playing Mara\n\nClose melee with a greataxe. Rage has two uses; regain one on a Short Rest and all on a Long Rest.\n\n## Creation choices\n\nStandard array, then the Soldier background increases, is reflected in the final ability scores. Soldier supplies its listed skills, tool, and origin feat. Human Versatile supplies Skilled; Skillful supplies nature. Skilled choices: insight stealth acrobatics. Class skill choices: perception survival. Starting equipment uses class option A and background option A, with 29 GP retained. Languages: Common, Dwarvish, and Elvish. Human Resourceful grants Heroic Inspiration after a Long Rest.\n\nAll identity, personality, background, ability, equipment, skill, and spell choices can be changed on an independent copy. Keep the declared creation rules when changing mechanical choices.","content_sha256":"c7554f503f68bb11c40b6cfb4b786cde3a4b04a98df25b5a4ad0240a89b07598","profile_status":"authored","setting_data":{},"source_id":"participant-a131d9650240cc833aac4df4-c7554f503f68bb11"},"name":"Mara Flint","participant_id":"participant-85db7ab1e54b7b209a9480f6","party_role":"player_character","summary":"Barbarian \u00b7 Level 1. Close melee with a greataxe. Rage has two uses; regain one on a Short Rest and all on a Long Rest."}]}]},{"kind":"library","plan_id":"last-cart-through","candidate_id":"cand-cart","setting_id":"pneuma.severed-lands","variant":null,"player":"participant-98da4ac31c3a34c51498a2d3-94926ac6a61a7489","companions":["participant-3a7b67a84e5d0735e4ea9e54-a8ea64185585deff"],"intent":null,"outcome":["ok",{"participants":[{"participant_id":"participant-b2ed5468d4f75d275293e177","kind":"player_character","package_id":"sylvia.srd-lite.bg3","package_version":"0.3.29","data":{"abilities":{"charisma":8,"constitution":14,"dexterity":14,"intelligence":10,"strength":17,"wisdom":12},"background":"Soldier","classes":[{"id":"fighter","level":1}],"fighting_styles":[{"